<title>DENMARK: Danish ISS wins Swedish care contracts.</title>
<headline>Danish ISS wins Swedish care contracts.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish cleaning group International Service System(ISS) announced on Tuesday it had won old age care service contracts with south Sweden's Halsingborg Town Council with an overall annual turnover of 57 million crowns.</p>
<p>ISS said the contracts involved its  ISS Care Service unit running home care and assistance services for old people in Halsingborg and its outlying district as well as cleaning and food delivery services and from January 1998 the operation of an old peoples' home.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
